      ":question/problem": "The basis $B$ of $R^{3}$ and the matrix $[T]_{B}$ of the linear transformation $T: R^{3} \u2192 R^{3}$ relative to $B$ are given by\n\n$B = {\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}, \\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}, \\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}}, [T]_{B} = \\begin{bmatrix}a & 2 & -5 \\\\ 2 & b & 7 \\\\ -1 & 0 & c\\end{bmatrix}$.\n\nWhat is the value of $a + b + c$, given that\n\n$T(b_{1}) = \\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}, T(b_{2}) = \\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}, T(b_{3}) = \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}$."
